OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 14 JAN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizbaeth Alker with an afternoon
OL,6,     Gof great music-making including
OL,7,     Gexclusive recordings to mark
OL,8,     GAmerica 250 and highlights from
OL,9,     Gour regular weekly concerts from
OL,10,     GWigmore Hall.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GFrom St Lawrence Church, York,
OL,13,     Gwith the Ebor Singers, with music
OL,14,     Gby Richard Allain, Lucy Walker,
OL,15,     GBairstow and Buxtehude.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Gottschalk
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod follows Gottschalk
OL,18,     Gas he tours Spain, before
OL,19,     Greturning to America to try and
OL,20,     Gmake his name in New York.
