OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham is joined by BBC New
OL,6,     GGeneration Artists the Astatine
OL,7,     GTrio for a live performance.And
OL,8,     Gpianist Duncan Honeybourne has a
OL,9,     Gnew album of music by Reginald
OL,10,     GRedman.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GRelax with a 30 minute soundscape
OL,13,     Gof classical music including
OL,14,     Gworks by Faure, Handel, Chopin
OL,15,     Gand Dvorak.
OL,16,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,17,     GDalia Stasevska conducts Mahler's
OL,18,     GSymphony No. 4, with soprano
OL,19,     GJoelle Harvey, while Augustin
OL,20,     GHadelich is the soloist in
OL,21,     GBarber's violin concerto.
