OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Five Kinds of Amadeus
OL,5,     GGeoffrey Colman speaks to Dame
OL,6,     GJane Glover about Peter Shaffer's
OL,7,     GAmadeus, and the reality of
OL,8,     GMozart's life.
OL,9,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,10,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,11,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,12,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,13,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,14,     Geverything in between.
OL,15,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,16,     GFergus McCreadie, sitting in all
OL,17,     Gweek for Soweto Kinch, presents
OL,18,     G'Round Midnight - a weeknight
OL,19,     Gcelebration of jazz from across
OL,20,     Gthe spectrum, with a particular
OL,21,     Gfocus on new UK music.
